  "detailed_description": "The scheme &amp;quot;Subsidy For Battery Operated Three-wheelers&amp;quot; by the Climate Change Department, Government of Gujarat, aims to encourage the use of clean energy-based vehicles for the transportation of passengers and goods, thereby reducing dependency on petrol and mitigating pollution. Beneficiaries, including rickshaw drivers, women entrepreneurs, startups, unemployed youth, educational institutions, cooperatives, NGOs, local bodies, and yatras, can avail a subsidy on a reimbursement basis after purchasing battery-operated three-wheelers from Gujarat Energy Development Agency (GEDA) authorized manufacturers and dealers.\n<br>\n\n",
  "eligibility": "\n   1. The applicant must be a resident of Gujarat.\n   1. The applicant must be an individual (such as rickshaw drivers, women entrepreneurs, startups, educated unemployed individuals) or an institution (such as cooperatives, NGOs, educational institutions, local bodies, yatras).\n   1. The applicant must purchase a battery-operated three-wheeler from a GEDA-authorized manufacturer or dealer.\n   1. The applicant must apply through authorized dealers linked with GEDA.\n\n<br>\n\n",
  "exclusions": "<br>\n\n",
